# SPEC-07 — Audio

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-07-audio.md`. Inherits SPEC-00. Do not build from it until the user feeds this spec.

Voice id, clone, alignment, the lip-sync checkbox, ElevenLabs SFX, and Suno music are the wired path. TTS model, stability, and style are fixed in code. New ElevenLabs or Suno calls go through the pause-aware chokepoint. Music stays Suno. SFX stays ElevenLabs.
